  "scenario": "Compare 100 Hz, 1000 Hz and restored 100 Hz with the same fixed-size 60-second Qt Quick Vulkan scene and stock KWin. Use a separate boot in each arm, the same graphics DTB, and a 10000 microsecond DRM safety margin.",
  "expected": "Check the reported timer rate. Measure condition-variable wake overshoot, Qt frame swaps and sampled CRTC framebuffer changes separately.",
  "observed": "The 1 ms condition-variable timeout overshoot median fell from 19.006 and 18.999 ms in the controls to 0.999 ms at 1000 Hz. Sampled CRTC framebuffer changes increased to 33.341 per second. Qt frame swaps fell to 33.783 per second. The results do not establish a general desktop frame-rate improvement.",
